{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "There's Something In The Ice",
    "steam_appid": 2810580,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810580/extras/b64cd1cb476a76d608d819fcbacd49b8.avif?t=1711386976\" width=640 height=82 /></span><br><br><strong><u>There's Something In The Ice</u></strong> is a first-person horror game.<br><br><strong>Plot:</strong><br>In 2015, three scientists at the Antarctic research station Zarya drilled into the ice to a depth of 2 kilometers and took samples to study...<br>As they were returning to base, a severe snowstorm began.<br>Arriving at the base, the scientists went down to the old bunker, as the security protocol told them, to wait it out...<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There is not a single note in the game. The plot is presented through dialogues with characters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realistic graphics.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Advanced lighting system LUMEN (Unreal Engine 5).</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Atmosphere inspired by the movie &quot;The Thing&quot; and other sci-fi films and games.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810580/extras/b64cd1cb476a76d608d819fcbacd49b8.avif?t=1711386976\" width=640 height=82 /></span><br><br><strong><u>There's Something In The Ice</u></strong> is a first-person horror game.<br><br><strong>Plot:</strong><br>In 2015, three scientists at the Antarctic research station Zarya drilled into the ice to a depth of 2 kilometers and took samples to study...<br>As they were returning to base, a severe snowstorm began.<br>Arriving at the base, the scientists went down to the old bunker, as the security protocol told them, to wait it out...<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>There is not a single note in the game. The plot is presented through dialogues with characters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realistic graphics.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Advanced lighting system LUMEN (Unreal Engine 5).</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Atmosphere inspired by the movie &quot;The Thing&quot; and other sci-fi films and games.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In 2015, three scientists at the Antarctic research station &quot;Zarya&quot; drilled into the ice to a depth of 2 kilometers and took samples for study... It seems that what they found was not at all what they were looking for...",
